---
import '../../../styles/global.css';
import SiteHeader from '../../../components/SiteHeader.astro';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" /><title>PL8000 Smart Power Monitoring Terminal | Linked Power</title></head>
  <body class="bg-white text-slate-900 antialiased">
    <SiteHeader locale="en" />
    <main class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 pb-16"><div class="pt-8 text-sm text-slate-500"><a href="/en/" class="hover:text-brand-red">Home</a><span class="px-2">/</span><span>Power Monitoring Terminal</span></div><section class="grid gap-10 border-b border-slate-200 py-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.95fr_1.05fr] lg:items-center lg:py-14"><figure class="order-2 flex min-h-80 items-center justify-center bg-slate-50 p-6 lg:order-1"><img src="/pl8000-device.png" alt="PaiLogic PL8000 Smart Power Monitoring Terminal" class="max-h-[30rem] w-full object-contain" /></figure><div class="order-1 lg:order-2"><p class="mb-4 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-brand-red">PL8000 Smart Power Monitoring Terminal</p><div class="mb-4 flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-2 text-sm text-slate-500"><span>Product code: <strong class="text-slate-900">PL8000</strong></span><span>Power Monitoring Terminal</span></div><h1 class="max-w-[22ch] text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">PaiLogic PL8000 Smart Power Monitoring Terminal</h1><p class="mt-6 max-w-[60ch] text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">A premium power monitoring terminal designed for modern power systems, combining real-time control with flexible application capabilities.</p><a href="/en/#contact" class="mt-8 inline-flex bg-brand-red px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-brand-red-dark">Consult Now</a></div></section><section class="border-b border-slate-200 py-8"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#101b70]">Key specifications</h2><div class="mt-5 grid gap-px overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 bg-slate-200 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="bg-white px-5 py-4"><span class="text-xs text-slate-500">Operating system</span><strong class="mt-2 block text-slate-900">Linux + RTOS</strong></div><div class="bg-white px-5 py-4"><span class="text-xs text-slate-500">Display</span><strong class="mt-2 block text-slate-900">640 × 480 color touch display</strong></div><div class="bg-white px-5 py-4"><span class="text-xs text-slate-500">Storage</span><strong class="mt-2 block text-slate-900">8 GB</strong></div><div class="bg-white px-5 py-4"><span class="text-xs text-slate-500">Communication</span><strong class="mt-2 block text-slate-900">RS485, Ethernet</strong></div></div></section><nav class="border-b border-slate-200 py-5"><p class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-slate-500">In this product</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-6 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700"><a href="#overview">Overview</a><a href="#base-functions">Base Functions</a><a href="#enhancements">Optional Enhancements</a><a href="#customization">Customization</a></div></nav><div class="space-y-10 py-8"><section id="overview" class="scroll-mt-24 border-t border-slate-200 pt-8"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#101b70]">Overview</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-base leading-8 text-slate-600">Built to international product standards, PL8000 embeds both Linux and RTOS to support real-time measurement and diverse applications.</p></section><section id="base-functions" class="scroll-mt-24 border-t border-slate-200 pt-8"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#101b70]">Base Functions</h2><ul class="mt-5 grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-2"><li class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 leading-7 text-slate-700">Full electrical parameter measurement with half-wave updates (10 ms at 50 Hz).</li><li class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 leading-7 text-slate-700">Continuous power quality monitoring with precise event timestamps and data recording.</li><li class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 leading-7 text-slate-700">High-resolution 640 × 480 color touch display.</li><li class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 leading-7 text-slate-700">8 GB storage for long-term, fine-grained historical data.</li><li class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 leading-7 text-slate-700">Configurable historical trends, time-of-use energy totals, and power quality events.</li><li class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 leading-7 text-slate-700">Up to 20 threshold comparators and 40 Boolean operators for alarm and protection logic.</li><li class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 leading-7 text-slate-700">RS485 and Ethernet networking with multiple communication protocols.</li></ul></section><section id="enhancements" class="scroll-mt-24 border-t border-slate-200 pt-8"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#101b70]">Optional Enhancements</h2><ul class="mt-5 grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-2"><li class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 leading-7 text-slate-700">Expandable digital and analog I/O modules, including temperature monitoring.</li><li class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 leading-7 text-slate-700">Microsecond-accurate PTP time synchronization (IEEE 588).</li><li class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 leading-7 text-slate-700">Multiple waveform-recording triggers, including power quality events, digital signals, user commands, and synchronized recording.</li><li class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 leading-7 text-slate-700">PMU synchronous phasor measurement unit.</li><li class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 leading-7 text-slate-700">Embedded soft PLC for real-time local control logic.</li><li class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 leading-7 text-slate-700">AI model prediction and control powered by the terminal GPU.</li></ul></section><section id="customization" class="scroll-mt-24 border-t border-slate-200 pt-8"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#101b70]">Customization</h2><p class="mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-600">Functions can be customized for specific site requirements.</p></section></div><section class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-8"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#101b70]">Product and system views</h2><figure class="mt-5 border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4"><img src="/pl8000-overview.png" alt="PL8000 overview" class="max-h-[30rem] w-full object-contain" loading="lazy" /></figure></section><section class="mt-10 flex flex-col justify-between gap-5 bg-slate-50 px-6 py-7 sm:flex-row sm:items-center"><div><p class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Talk to an expert</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600">We provide professional technical support and solutions.</p></div><a href="/en/#contact" class="bg-brand-red px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-brand-red-dark">Consult Now</a></section></main>
  </body>
</html>

<script>
  const heroImage = document.querySelector('img[src="/pl8000-device.png"]');
  const productViews = [
    '/pl8000/pl8000-view1.png',
    '/pl8000/pl8000-view2.png',
    '/pl8000/pl8000-view3.jpg',
    '/pl8000/pl8000-view4.jpg',
  ];

  if (heroImage) {
    let viewIndex = 0;

    window.setInterval(() => {
      viewIndex = (viewIndex + 1) % productViews.length;
      heroImage.classList.add('opacity-0');

      window.setTimeout(() => {
        heroImage.src = productViews[viewIndex];
        heroImage.classList.remove('opacity-0');
      }, 250);
    }, 4500);
  }
</script>